{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a5254282-1025-870d-9124-ddaf723f3add",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T14:04:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:02:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Happy Monday, I guess. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:02:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Terrence Brennan. I got a parking ticket on my windshield Saturday, says I was too close to a hydrant. And I wasn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the number off the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, I'm on speaker, I've got it right here. [pause] Sorry, my hands are a mess. It's, uh, the number starts with a K, K as in king, then 4, 4, 0, 1, 7, 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "K440172. Got it. Pulling it up. Okay, hydrant violation, issued Saturday morning. What's the issue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:02:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The issue is I measured. Well, I went back and looked. I'm a good ten, twelve feet off that thing. I told the guy at my shop, and he said, you gotta fight that, and I said, I'm going to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten or twelve feet. Did you pace it or tape it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paced it. Which, fine, isn't a tape measure. But she wrote it like I was parked right on top of it. My neighbor said she said the officer doesn't even measure, they just eyeball it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't speak to what your neighbor heard. What I can tell you is the officer usually takes a photo with the ticket. Would you like to see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's what I want. Can you email me the photo? Then I can see what they're seeing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send a request over to the parking office to get it to you. Do I have an email on the account, or should I take one now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take a new one. Hold on, I'm sorry, I'm learning calligraphy and the ink is still wet, I don't want to smear the page. Okay. Go ahead and I'll spell it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Calligraphy, nice. Go ahead whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's T Brennan, B-R-E-N-N-A-N, then the number 52, at a mail service. I'll say the rest slow. [pause] Sorry, you there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:04:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here. I've got the address, and I'm reading it back so we're sure. T Brennan 52, and the rest as you gave it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:04:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's right. And the ticket, I don't pay it in the meantime, right? Because the guy said, don't pay till you see it. And I said, I wasn't planning to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:04:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Once the dispute is noted, you're fine to hold off while it's reviewed. I'll make a note on the ticket. The photo should reach you in a few business days. If it doesn't, call back and give me that ticket number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:04:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. Thanks. Ten feet, I'm telling you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Duly noted. Have a good afternoon, Mr. Brennan."
    }
  ],
